  "autoMode": {
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(git stash:*) — stashing wipes unstaged work in progress (high-risk data loss)",
      "Writes to config/secrets/prod/** or any other prod secrets path — treat as a sensitive prod-namespace write"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Source control**: personal repos on GitHub (public unless the repo says otherwise); IWF work repos on git.iwf.io (internal, assume private) and github.com/iwf-web",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: none — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Sensitive data locations**: .env* files (except *.dist), config/secrets/**, *.private.php, private keys",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace/host/container with `prod`/`production` as a whole segment",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development",
      "**Trusted repo**: the repo in the current working directory and its origin remote",
      "**IWF repos** (remote on git.iwf.io or github.com/iwf-web, or a `.iwf.yml` in the project root): the `iwf` CLI is the containerized command runner; running project commands through it is routine"
    ]
  },
  "voiceEnabled": true
